flowchart TD
    Start([User Opens Application]) --> LoadInitial[Load Default Mandatory Benchmark NFA]
    LoadInitial --> DisplayDashboard[Render Dashboard Overview]

    DisplayDashboard --> UserAction{Select Application Tab}

    UserAction -->|Tab: NFA Configuration| ConfigMode[Open NFA Config Editor]
    ConfigMode --> EditOption{Edit Method}
    EditOption -->|Load Preset| PickPreset[Choose from Preset Library]
    EditOption -->|Custom Definition| ManualEdit[Define Q, Σ, q0, F and δ]
    PickPreset --> TriggerValidation[Run validateNFA]
    ManualEdit --> TriggerValidation

    TriggerValidation --> CheckValid{Is NFA Valid?}
    CheckValid -->|No| ShowErrors[Display Error / Warning Alert Banners]
    ShowErrors --> ConfigMode
    CheckValid -->|Yes| AutoConvert[Trigger convertNFAtoDFA via useMemo]

    UserAction -->|Tab: NFA Visualization| RenderNFAGraph[Compute Dagre Layout & Render NFA Nodes/Edges]
    
    AutoConvert --> StoreDFA[Store Generated DFA & Conversion Steps]

    UserAction -->|Tab: Step-by-Step Conversion| StepperView[Render Conversion Stepper]
    StoreDFA --> StepperView
    StepperView --> StepControls{User Control}
    StepControls -->|Next / Prev| UpdateStepIndex[Change safeStepIndex]
    StepControls -->|Auto-Play| PlayTimer[Start Interval Timer 0.5x, 1x, 2x]
    StepControls -->|Show All| JumpEnd[Jump to Final Step]
    UpdateStepIndex --> RenderStepCard[Display StepExplanationCard & IntermediateDFATable]
    PlayTimer --> RenderStepCard
    JumpEnd --> RenderStepCard

    UserAction -->|Tab: DFA Visualization| RenderDFAGraph[Compute Dagre Layout & Render DFA Nodes with Subsets]
    StoreDFA --> RenderDFAGraph

    UserAction -->|Tab: Transition Tables| TablesView[Display Side-by-Side NFA and DFA Tables]
    StoreDFA --> TablesView
    TablesView --> ExportAction{Export Format}
    ExportAction -->|CSV| DownloadCSV[Trigger Browser CSV Download]
    ExportAction -->|Markdown| CopyMD[Copy GitHub Flavored Table to Clipboard]

    UserAction -->|Tab: String Simulator| SimView[Open String Tester & Tape Interface]
    StoreDFA --> SimView
    SimView --> EnterString[User Enters String w or selects preset]
    EnterString --> RunSim[Execute simulateDFA]
    RunSim --> TraceDisplay[Render Execution Trace Table]
    RunSim --> TapeDisplay[Highlight Consumed Tape Characters]
    RunSim --> SyncGraph[Pulse Active State Node in DFA Diagram]
    RunSim --> ShowVerdict[Display ACCEPTED / REJECTED Banner]
